hp-parser/lib/PhpParser/NodeTraverser.php(181): Psalm\\Visitor\\DependencyFinderVisitor->enterNode(Object(PhpParser\\Node\\Stmt\\Class_))\r\n#3 /vagrant/Web-Secure/vendor/nikic/php-parser/lib/PhpParser/NodeTraverser.php(108): PhpParser\\NodeTraverser->traverseArray(Array)\r\n#4 /vagrant/Web-Secure/vendor/nikic/php-parser/lib/PhpParser/NodeTraverser.php(200): PhpParser\\NodeTraverser->traverseNode(Object(PhpParser\\Node\\Stmt\\N in /vagrant/Web-Secure/vendor/vimeo/psalm/src/Psalm/Visitor/DependencyFinderVisitor.php on line 1159\r\n```\r\n\r\nTrying to figure out why it's failing, I see that if I remove [this](https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle/blob/6.3.0/src/Client.php#L11-L24), the error is gone.\r\n\r\nI am not entirely sure the if the problem is in that library or in one of my usages of it... I have another project with a slightly different version of guzzle that parses with no problems (and has the same annotations).\r\nAny ideas? \r\nI am running psalm with `--debug-by-line` but that's all the information I get out of it.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/820/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]